From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2000
From: OHOS Rust <ohos-rust@example.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] OHOS f16: skip doctests requiring reliable f16 math

OHOS (musl libc) lacks reliable f16 math functions. Add
`not(target_env = "ohos")` to doctest cfg guards so f16 math
doctests are skipped on OHOS targets.

Note: f128.rs doctest cfg guards are already handled in
0003-ohos-native-build-support.patch.

---

diff --git a/library/std/src/num/f16.rs b/library/std/src/num/f16.rs
